## Goal

Use fresh Pokémon GO Team GO Rocket lineup data to create practical battle parties from the user's actual Pokémon collection.

## Scope

When #124 provides a fresh Team GO Rocket snapshot:

- map Grunt encounter phrases/types to supported possible Pokémon lineups;
- support Leader lineups with branching slots;
- support Giovanni's current Pokémon GO lineup and Shadow encounter facts;
- evaluate Pokémon GO Fast Attack pressure, Protect Shield consumption, resistance, Charge

